msgid "2. Wildfire Games has legitimate interests in providing the Multiplayer Lobby, in the development and improvement of 0 A.D. and the Multiplayer Lobby, in enforcing the Terms of Use and in the protection against cyberattacks (GDPR 6.1.f)."
msgstr "2. Wildfire Games 在开发和改进本游戏中，将合法提供多人游戏大厅服务。并执行使用条款来阻止网络攻击(GDPR 6.1.f)。"

